/* ---------- Feature map / changelog ---------- */
FEATURE_MAP.push(['20 · v6.1 — status first, the change loop',[
 ['Status-first home','real (browser)','Ongoing events, pending tasks, what changed — for every signed-in role except staff (who keep Today). Money and risk moved to the Company page; the owner shows money on request','Home'],
 ['Event overview = running order','real (browser)','Next function\'s run-sheet lines with owners, your duties marked, open changes, pending tasks; everything else behind "More"','Event'],
 ['Coordinator role','real (browser)','Everything operational, no amounts; Vismaya in the sample','Team'],
 ['Change loop','real (browser)','Something changed → affected vendors only → versioned ask per vendor → opened = acknowledged → accepted with feasibility, extra amount, ready-by → costed to the client at the quoted margin → client authorises by link → sign-off raises each vendor\'s agreement by their delta → duties reviewed. Deadline = earlier of 48 h and a quarter of the time left (floor 2 h); unanswered past it is a blocker; verbal answers and chases recorded','Changes'],
 ['Duties move with the function','real (browser)','Changing a function\'s start shifts its run-sheet lines and opens a loop asking its vendors to confirm; crew on that date flagged','Functions'],
 ['Calendar day / week / month with filters','real (browser)','Functions, tasks, crew, vendor on site, money due, prints, change deadlines; by event and person; tap opens the thing where it lives','Calendar'],
 ['Review lands on the thing','real (browser)','Approval items open the right tab (vendors / expenses / changes) instead of the event home','Home'],
 ['Task photos','real (browser)','Photos with captions on tasks — truck bay, unloading corner, finished table','Tasks'],
 ['Contract: your paper','real (browser)','Edit the generated text or attach your own format; signing uses exactly that text','Client approvals'],
 ['Vendor contact persons','real (browser)','Contact, phone/WhatsApp, backup on the vendor; shown in the directory and on each agreement','Vendors'],
 ['My Time is a module, off by default','real (browser)','Hours-by-event costing only when the owner switches it on','Modules']
]]);
CHANGELOG.unshift(['v6.1 (this build)','Status first and the change loop, from the second planner session and the team review. Home and event overview lead with the running order, pending tasks and what changed; money moved to the Company page. Coordinator role. The change loop: affected vendors only, versioned asks with feasibility and price delta before the client decides, deadline relative to time left, escalation, one status screen, duties reviewed. Function time changes move run-sheet lines. Calendar with day/week/month and filters. Review deep-links fixed; task photos; contract text editable or own format; vendor contact persons; My Time off by default. Not built on purpose: WhatsApp reminders (sandboxed channel), client call minutes, load plan — after the four field tests.']);
ASSUMPTIONS.push('Change-loop deadline rule (earlier of 48 h and a quarter of the time left, floor 2 h) is an assumption to test with a real vendor.');
ASSUMPTIONS.push('A loop change puts the vendor cost to the client at the event\'s quoted margin by default; the planner can override.');
